Jesper "'''tenzki'''" Plougmann {{born}} is a [[:Category:Denmark|Danish]] professional ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' coach and a former ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' coach and player. He retired on January 10, 2022 to pursue a career in [[valorant:tenzki|''VALORANT'']], but returned to ''CS:GO'' in March 2022. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamHeretics/status/1480565951976427526|title=THE ROSTER|date=2022-01-10|author=[[Team Heretics]]}}</ref>

